# AI SDK v7 migration: `chat`/`chat-adapter-sendblue` (messaging transport) still declare an
# OPTIONAL peer on `ai@^6`. Sunny only uses chat's transport surface (Chat + sendblue adapter +
# Message/Thread types), not chat's ai-dependent agent feature, and chat's runtime `ai` imports
# (generateText/tool) still exist in v7 — so ai@7 is safe here. Until chat ships ai@7 support,
# relax npm's strict optional-peer check so installs resolve. Revisit when `chat` supports ai@7.
legacy-peer-deps=true
